{"id":"big-green-egg","title":"The Big Green Egg","level":1,"series":"Dash Adventures","cover":{"h":"3c9573fcf5dfa37df75a5874ec1fce15","t":"image/webp"},"titleAudio":null,"cast":[{"role":"hero","name":"Logan","portrait":{"h":"cf541143e9c73f6a4921ebd5175623cb","t":"image/webp"}},{"role":"sister","name":"Anastasia","portrait":{"h":"4b8a1a7bc845473e95a93b7d3c7d3a7d","t":"image/webp"}},{"role":"dad","name":"Dad","portrait":{"h":"4a3effd5da379d9c095d2ece4f986c49","t":"image/webp"}},{"role":"mum","name":"Mum","portrait":{"h":"4e8d5c2035e2129d567a2a2bbf62e944","t":"image/webp"}}],"mystery":"A big green egg... what is inside?","practise":["egg","shed","crack","chomp","quick","tail"],"common":["the","he","her","little","out","we"],"challenge":["dinosaur","coming"],"before":"Look at the cover. What do you think is inside the big green egg?","after":["What did Dash chomp?","Why did Logan and Anastasia put Dash in the box?","How did Dad find out about Dash?","What would you do if you found a big egg?"],"retell":[2,4,5,8,12,15],"pages":[{"text":"Logan and Anastasia are in Dad's shed.","bubble":null,"image":{"h":"db64dc875b18489335fcf7007c585586","t":"image/webp"},"alt":"Inside a cosy, slightly messy wooden garden shed on a sunny morning: tools on hooks, plant pots, a wheelbarrow, sunbeams through a dusty window.","audio":{"text":null,"bubble":null}},{"text":"Logan spots a big green egg.","bubble":null,"image":{"h":"98215168d6d129e22bd15395593a8cd8","t":"image/webp"},"alt":"Close-up: Logan lifts a flower pot to reveal a huge egg, as big as a football, bright green with darker green spots, nestled in straw.","audio":{"text":null,"bubble":null}},{"text":"Anastasia taps it. Tap, tap, tap!","bubble":null,"image":{"h":"8e15d45503cda7c18a491cc29750613d","t":"image/webp"},"alt":"Anastasia gently taps the big green egg with one finger, little motion lines around her finger.","audio":{"text":null,"bubble":null}},{"text":"Crack! The egg splits.","bubble":null,"image":{"h":"626588e3edef0874039939b476541b54","t":"image/webp"},"alt":"A zig-zag crack shoots across the big green egg, a chip of shell pops off and a soft golden glow leaks out.","audio":{"text":null,"bubble":null}},{"text":"Out pops a little dinosaur!","bubble":{"who":"dash","name":"Dash","text":"I am Dash!","side":"left"},"image":{"h":"a1a2c5704e9792dbfd4ab0b074d688f9","t":"image/webp"},"alt":"Dash bursts out of the top of the egg with a piece of shell on his head like a hat, arms wide and a huge happy grin.","audio":{"text":null,"bubble":null}},{"text":"Dash gets Dad's sock. Chomp, chomp!","bubble":null,"image":{"h":"38c3ae34967c9c12c8ab2b0fbfa203a0","t":"image/webp"},"alt":"Dash has pulled a long stripy sock out of a laundry basket in the shed and is chomping the toe end, tugging it like a puppy.","audio":{"text":null,"bubble":null}},{"text":"Then he chomps Dad's hat!","bubble":null,"image":{"h":"b181b3e6590a24ab2b5bc59095521165","t":"image/webp"},"alt":"Dash is now inside Dad's floppy sun hat, which is far too big for him, nibbling the brim.","audio":{"text":null,"bubble":null}},{"text":"Dad is coming!","bubble":{"who":"hero","name":"Logan","text":"Quick, Dash! Get in the box!","side":"left"},"image":{"h":"792ec4da928579ef6455cdde3c4e9b17","t":"image/webp"},"alt":"Through the shed window we see Dad walking up the garden path holding a mug of tea.","audio":{"text":null,"bubble":null}},{"text":"Dad looks in. He sees Logan and Anastasia.","bubble":null,"image":{"h":"b4d216323fb634f250d115924d7f5c61","t":"image/webp"},"alt":"Dad stands in the shed doorway with his mug, eyebrows raised.","audio":{"text":null,"bubble":null}},{"text":"But the box has a tail!","bubble":null,"image":{"h":"c7b2744bee6e1f05fb48dbf7c69b8b17","t":"image/webp"},"alt":"Visual joke: behind the children, a little turquoise-green tail pokes out of the cardboard box and wags.","audio":{"text":null,"bubble":null}},{"text":"Dad sits on the box.","bubble":{"who":"dash","name":"Dash","text":"Help!","side":"right"},"image":{"h":"27a03644b1b25030141b0da804624f69","t":"image/webp"},"alt":"Dad is just sitting down on the cardboard box to drink his tea.","audio":{"text":null,"bubble":null}},{"text":"Dad jumps up and lifts the lid.","bubble":{"who":"dad","name":"Dad","text":"A dinosaur!","side":"left"},"image":{"h":"2065fa64ec4612df7b2f0c4239cea576","t":"image/webp"},"alt":"Dad holds the box lid, mouth wide open in amazement.","audio":{"text":null,"bubble":null}},{"text":"Mum runs in. Dash licks her chin.","bubble":{"who":"sister","name":"Anastasia","text":"Can we keep him?","side":"left"},"image":{"h":"a16851d687f6f66b8842b9a47b23315c","t":"image/webp"},"alt":"Mum arrives at the shed door.","audio":{"text":null,"bubble":null}},{"text":"Mum and Dad nod. Yes!","bubble":null,"image":{"h":"8a5361d51c505e350d5001ef27f6e63e","t":"image/webp"},"alt":"Mum and Dad look at each other and nod with big smiles.","audio":{"text":null,"bubble":null}},{"text":"Now Dash naps in Dad's hat.","bubble":null,"image":{"h":"f86a5d93ff6fae8d10093f965798e581","t":"image/webp"},"alt":"Cosy evening bedroom with a night light: Dash curled up asleep inside Dad's floppy sun hat at the end of Logan's bed, the stripy sock as his blanket.","audio":{"text":null,"bubble":null}}],"words":{}}